msgid "Show Balance in contact list"
msgstr "Pokaži saldo u popisu kontakata"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:15
msgid "Whether to show account balances in the contact list."
msgstr "Hoće li se prikazivati salda računa u popisu kontakata"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:16
msgid "Hide main window"
msgstr "Sakrij glavni prozor"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:17
msgid "Hide the main window."
msgstr "Sakrij glavni prozor."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:18
msgid "Default directory to select an avatar image from"
msgstr "Uobičajeni direktorij za izbor avatara"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:19
msgid "The last directory that an avatar image was chosen from."
msgstr "Zadnji direktorij iz kojega je izabrana slika avatara"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:20
msgid "Open new chats in separate windows"
msgstr "Otvori nove razgovore u odvojenim prozorima"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:21
msgid "Always open a separate chat window for new chats."
msgstr "Uvijek otvori zaseban prozor za nove razgovore"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:22
msgid "Display incoming events in the status area"
msgstr "Prikazuj dolazeće događaje u području stanja"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:23
msgid ""
"Display incoming events in the status area. If false, present them to the "
"user immediately."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuj dolazeće događaje u području stanja. Ako je neistinito, odmah ih "
"predoči korisniku."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:24
msgid "The position for the chat window side pane"
msgstr "Položaj bočne ploče prozora čavrljanja"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:25
msgid "The stored position (in pixels) of the chat window side pane."
msgstr "Spremljeni položaj (u pikselima) bočne ploče prozora čavrljanja"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:26
msgid "Show contact groups"
msgstr "Prikaži grupe kontakta"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:27
msgid "Whether to show groups in the contact list."
msgstr "Treba li prikazati grupe u popisu kontakta."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:28
msgid "Use notification sounds"
msgstr "Koristi obavjesne zvukove"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:29
msgid "Whether to play a sound to notify of events."
msgstr "Hoće li se odsvirati zvuk kako bi se obavijestilo o događajima."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:30
msgid "Disable sounds when away"
msgstr "Onemogući zvukove kad nisam prisutan/na"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:31
msgid "Whether to play sound notifications when away or busy."
msgstr ""
"Hoće li se odsvirati zvuk kad korisnik nije prisutan ili je zaposlen."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:32
msgid "Play a sound for incoming messages"
msgstr "Sviraj zvuk za dolazne poruke"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:33
msgid "Whether to play a sound to notify of incoming messages."
msgstr ""
"Hoće li se odsvirati zvuk kako bi se obavijestilo o dolaznim porukama."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:34
msgid "Play a sound for outgoing messages"
msgstr "Sviraj zvuk za odlazne poruke"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:35
msgid "Whether to play a sound to notify of outgoing messages."
msgstr ""
"Hoće li se odsvirati zvuk kako bi se obavijestilo o izlaznim porukama."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:36
msgid "Play a sound for new conversations"
msgstr "Sviraj zvuk za nove razgovore"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:37
msgid "Whether to play a sound to notify of new conversations."
msgstr ""
"Hoće li se odsvirati zvuk kako bi se obavijestilo o novim razgovorima."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:38
msgid "Play a sound when a contact logs in"
msgstr "Sviraj zvuk kad se kontakt prijavi"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:39
msgid ""
"Whether to play a sound to notify of contacts logging into the network."
msgstr ""
"Hoće li se odsvirati zvuk kako bi se obavijestilo o kontaktima koji se "
"prijavljuju na mrežu."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:40
msgid "Play a sound when a contact logs out"
msgstr "Sviraj zvuk kad se kontakt odjavi"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:41
msgid ""
"Whether to play a sound to notify of contacts logging out of the network."
msgstr ""
"Hoće li se odsvirati zvuk kako bi se obavijestilo o kontaktima koji se "
"odjavljuju s mreže."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:42
msgid "Play a sound when we log in"
msgstr "Sviraj zvuk kad se mi prijavimo"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:43
msgid "Whether to play a sound when logging into a network."
msgstr "Hoće li se odsvirati zvuk pri prijavi u mrežu."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:44
msgid "Play a sound when we log out"
msgstr "Sviraj zvuk kad se mi odjavimo"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:45
msgid "Whether to play a sound when logging out of a network."
msgstr "Hoće li se odsvirati zvuk pri odjavi iz mreže."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:46
msgid "Enable popup notifications for new messages"
msgstr "Omogući skočne obavijesti za nove poruke"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:47
msgid "Whether to show a popup notification when receiving a new message."
msgstr "Hoće li se pokazati skočna obavijest pri primanju nove poruke."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:48
msgid "Disable popup notifications when away"
msgstr "Onemogući skočne obavijesti kad nisam prisutan/na"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:49
msgid "Whether to show popup notifications when away or busy."
msgstr ""
"Hoće li se pokazati skočne obavijesti kad korisnik nije prisutan ili je "
"zaposlen."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:50
msgid "Pop up notifications if the chat isn't focused"
msgstr "Skočne obavijesti ako prozor čavrljanja nije u fokusu"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:51
msgid ""
"Whether to show a popup notification when receiving a new message even if "
"the chat is already opened, but not focused."
msgstr ""
"Hoće li se pokazati skočna obavijest pri primanju nove poruke, čak i kad je "
"prozor čavrljanja otvoren, ali ne i fokusiran."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:52
msgid "Pop up notifications when a contact logs in"
msgstr "Skočne obavijesti kad se kontakt prijavi"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:53
msgid "Whether to show a popup notification when a contact goes online."
msgstr "Hoće li se pokazati skočna obavijest kad se kontakt spoji."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:54
msgid "Pop up notifications when a contact logs out"
msgstr "Skočne obavijesti kad se kontakt odjavi"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:55
msgid "Whether to show a popup notification when a contact goes offline."
msgstr "Hoće li se pokazati skočna obavijest kad se kontakt odspoji."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:56
msgid "Use graphical smileys"
msgstr "Koristi grafičke smješke"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:57
msgid "Whether to convert smileys into graphical images in conversations."
msgstr "Hoće li se smješci u razgovorima pretvarati u grafičke slike."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:58
msgid "Show contact list in rooms"
msgstr "Pokaži popis kontakata u sobama"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:59
msgid "Whether to show the contact list in chat rooms."
msgstr "Hoće li se pokazivati popis kontakata u sobama čavrljanja."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:60
msgid "Chat window theme"
msgstr "Tema prozora razgovora"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:61
msgid "The theme that is used to display the conversation in chat windows."
msgstr ""
"Tema koja se koristi za prikazivanje razgovora u prozorima čavrljanja."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:62
msgid "Chat window theme variant"
msgstr "Varijanta teme prozora čavrljanja"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:63
msgid ""
"The theme variant that is used to display the conversation in chat windows."
msgstr ""
"Varijanta teme koja se koristi pri prikazivanju razgovora u prozorima "
"čavrljanja."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:64
msgid "Path of the Adium theme to use"
msgstr "Put Adium teme za korištenje"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:65
msgid ""
"Path of the Adium theme to use if the theme used for chat is Adium. "
"Deprecated."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:66
msgid "Enable WebKit Developer Tools"
msgstr "Omogući WebKit razvojne alate"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:67
msgid ""
"Whether WebKit developer tools, such as the Web Inspector, should be enabled."
msgstr "Hoće li se omogućiti WebKit razvojni alati, poput Web Inspectora."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:68
msgid "Inform other users when you are typing to them"
msgstr "Obavijesti druge korisnike kada im tipkate"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:69
msgid ""
"Whether to send the 'composing' or 'paused' chat states. Does not currently "
"affect the 'gone' state."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:70
msgid "Use theme for chat rooms"
msgstr "Koristi temu za sobe čavrljanja"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:71
msgid "Whether to use the theme for chat rooms."
msgstr "Hoće li se koristiti tema za sobe čavrljanja."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:72
msgid "Spell checking languages"
msgstr "Jezici za provjeru pravopisa"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:73
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of spell checker languages to use (e.g. \"en, fr, nl\")."
msgstr ""
"Popis jezika, odvojenih zarezom, s podrškom za provjeru pravopisa (npr. "
"\"en, fr, nl\")."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:74
msgid "Enable spell checker"
msgstr "Omogući provjeru pravopisa"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:75
msgid ""
"Whether to check words typed against the languages you want to check with."
msgstr ""
"Hoće li se provjeravati otipkane riječi u odabranim jezicima za provjeru."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:76
msgid "Nick completed character"
msgstr "Znak završenog nadimka"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:77
msgid ""
"Character to add after nickname when using nick completion (tab) in group "
"chat."
msgstr ""
"Znak za dodavanje nakon nadimka pri korištenju dopune nadimka (tipka tab) u "
"grupnom razgovoru."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:78
msgid "Empathy should use the avatar of the contact as the chat window icon"
msgstr ""
"Empathy bi trebao koristiti avatar kontakta kao ikonu prozora razgovora"

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:79
msgid ""
"Whether Empathy should use the avatar of the contact as the chat window icon."
msgstr ""
"Treba li Empathy koristiti avatar kontakta kao ikonu prozora čavrljanja."

#: ../data/org.gnome.Empathy.gschema.xml.h:80
